  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Judicial Quality Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The activities aimed at strengthening the role of the HJPC entail the implementation of EU peer review recommendations related to appointment, appraisal and promotion of judges, according to the criteria of the European Network of Councils for the Judiciary (ENCJ).</narrative>
  </description>
